  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMART ANTI-POACHING IN PROTECTED AND UNPROTECTED TIGER HABITAT IN RUSSIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our goal is to increase population sizes of tigers and their prey in Russia. Within the context of this proposal we will work toward this goal primarily by improving anti-poaching effectiveness in seven key protected areas and continue expanding the program to wildlife management authorities in the Amur Province.</narrative>
  </description>
